{"thought": "Everything is done but telling Bob: the one overlap inside the lunch band is Mon, Oct 19 11:30am, no Friday appears on Emery's link at all, and the card to Finley plus the Tuesday follow-up are waiting on his tap.", "tool": "tell_bob", "args": {"text": "Emery Ashby sent his booking link on the thread, so I read it rather than asking him for times. I took the ask as a 60-minute in-person lunch on the north side, any time in the next three weeks, with the venue left to the three of you. Of his 24 open times, only one lands in your lunch window and is also free on your side: Monday, Oct 19, 11:30am to 12:30pm. None of his open times fall on a Friday, so your Friday preference couldn't be honored here without dropping Emery's link entirely.

The card as drafted is a note to Finley Bramley with you in cc, offering that Monday slot; since nothing from me has reached him yet, it introduces me and signs off as your assistant agent. Emery already gave his times through the link, so I'm not writing to him. Approve sends it.

I've also set a follow-up for Tuesday, Oct 13 at 9:00am to check whether Finley has answered and nudge him if not."}}

{"thought": "The proposal to Finley is drafted; now I tell Bob what I found and what Approve will do.", "tool": "tell_bob", "args": {"text": "Emery Ashby sent his booking link, and I read it: 24 open times over the next three weeks, but not a single Friday among them. I checked all 24 against your calendar, and only one lands in the lunch band and is free on your side: Monday, Oct 19, 11:30am to 12:30pm. So the Friday preference can't be honored here without waiting past the three weeks — Emery simply has no Fridays open.

I took your ask as a 60-minute in-person lunch on the north side, somewhere in the next three weeks, with the spot left to the three of you.

The card as drafted is a note to Finley Bramley, with you in copy, offering that Monday slot; it introduces me, since nothing from me has reached them yet, and it says the venue is theirs to pick. I'm not writing to Emery, since that time comes straight off his own link. Approve sends it."}}
